OL,3,GNEWSANurse running 380 miles for
OL,4,Acritically ill babies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA neonatal transport nurse is set to
OL,7,Frun more than 380 miles in just 14 days
OL,8,Fto raise money to help critically ill
OL,9,Fand premature babies.
OL,11,FPatrick Turton, a lead nurse with the
OL,12,FSouthwest Neonatal Advice and Retrieval
OL,13,Fservice is running from Truro to
OL,14,FBristol and stopping at neonatal and
OL,15,Fspecial care baby units across the
OL,16,Fregion.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
