OL,3,GNEWSANurse running 380 miles for
OL,4,Acritically ill babies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe challenge will see him cover
OL,7,Fbetween 25 and 40 miles a day as he
OL,8,Fvisits hospitals in Plymouth, Torbay,
OL,9,FExeter, Taunton, Yeovil, Bath, Swindon
OL,10,Fand Gloucester before finishing at St
OL,11,FMichael's Hospital in Bristol on 24
OL,12,FSeptember.
OL,14,FSoNAR provides specialist advice and
OL,15,Ftransport for premature and critically
OL,16,Fill babies across 12 neonatal units in
OL,17,Fthe South West.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
